    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>I Believe in Giants</i></strong> is a 2.5D adventure game, where you play as Astro, a boy on a quest to rescue his puppy, Rocket, from the evil Snoozer and his henchmen.<br>Travel into Astro's Dream Worlds to face new enemies and challenges,  and unlock new forms, costumes and abilities along the way!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/7bca9dc20d802ff3b2b571b11ac33bde.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Explore unique dream worlds, each with multiple levels, unique enemies, and crazy boss fights!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/325ad18aa2ffa163f1fba9d6287adbf4.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Each dream world brings a new character form for Astro, along with fun new abilities and game mechanics!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/144f8d12d959cea18a80d68ba9c1426a.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Play alone in Single Player, or grab a friend and play the entire game in local co-op mode!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>I Believe in Giants</i></strong> is a 2.5D adventure game, where you play as Astro, a boy on a quest to rescue his puppy, Rocket, from the evil Snoozer and his henchmen.<br>Travel into Astro's Dream Worlds to face new enemies and challenges,  and unlock new forms, costumes and abilities along the way!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/7bca9dc20d802ff3b2b571b11ac33bde.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Explore unique dream worlds, each with multiple levels, unique enemies, and crazy boss fights!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/325ad18aa2ffa163f1fba9d6287adbf4.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Each dream world brings a new character form for Astro, along with fun new abilities and game mechanics!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845500/extras/144f8d12d959cea18a80d68ba9c1426a.avif?t=1725567313\" /></div><br>Play alone in Single Player, or grab a friend and play the entire game in local co-op mode!",
    "short_description": "Embark on a larger-than-life adventure through the fantastical dream worlds of Astro, a boy filled with endless wonder, to rescue your puppy, Rocket, from the clutches of the Evil Snoozer and his Henchmen. Take on each adventure with a unique form, new abilities and challenges. Sleep tight...",
